OrbRotate←{
   ⍝ Converts 2D orbital plane coordinates ⍵ to 3D heliocentric
   ⍝ Accounts for orientation and tilt of each orbit in orbital elements ⍺
    x←((⍴x),1)⍴x←1 0 1\⍵
    omega←Radian(Periangle ⍺)-Ascending ⍺
    omeg4←Radian Ascending ⍺
    i←InclRotate Radian Inclination ⍺
    o←LongRotate omega
    q←LongRotate omeg4
    h←(q Times i Times o)Times x
    (¯1↓⍴h)⍴h }
